# Teams App Versioning

When updating the Teams app manifest (`teams-app/manifest.json`), follow semantic versioning:

## Version Format: MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH

- **MAJOR** (X.0.0): Big features, breaking changes, architectural changes
  - Examples: New backend architecture, major UX overhaul, new platform support
  
- **MINOR** (0.X.0): Any other changes, new features, enhancements
  - Examples: New bot commands, UI improvements, additional endpoints
  
- **PATCH** (0.0.X): Bug fixes only
  - Examples: Typo fixes, minor bug fixes

## After Changing Version

Always rebuild the Teams app package after updating the manifest:

```powershell
cd teams-app
Compress-Archive -Path manifest.json, color.png, outline.png -DestinationPath northwind-ai.zip -Force
```

## Current Version History

